From c6de1840c8569cdb5225063857bb830885257ca0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: small-gear-lab <289302950+marie-222@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:19:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Enable the handoff and multi-window file opening on Linux

--reuse-instance, --new-window and --chdir were macOS-only. Build the
handoff listener, the OpenFiles event and the new-window path on all unix
targets, and add the Linux side of window creation and activation.
